        "Description": "Shepherd: Yesterday, you took down an entire base, I ask much more from you now. Frontlines are relics, the war rages everywhere, and there will be casualties. This man Habeeb Hannan, wages his own war, he has no rules, no boundaries, he doesn&apos;t flinch at torture, human trafficking, or genocide.\rHe plans to conduct a massacre in Berlin, a massacre that will leave dozens of innocent people dead. Hannan&apos;s men already infiltrated the club. Your job is to take them down. Happy hunting 47!",
